      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.13,
          "end": 4.87,
          "en": "So were you successful?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.87,
          "end": 6.19,
          "en": "Let's build this screen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.19,
          "end": 8.44,
          "en": "on which we output these categories together.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.45,
          "end": 13.04,
          "en": "And for that we don't need any special package,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 13.04,
          "end": 15.75,
          "en": "or any navigation specific tricks.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 15.75,
          "end": 18.46,
          "en": "Instead, what we can do is create a new folder",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 18.46,
          "end": 20.43,
          "en": "that we could name screens,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 20.43,
          "end": 22.87,
          "en": "since I wanna store my different components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 22.87,
          "end": 26.593,
          "en": "that will act as full screen components in there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 27.51,
          "end": 30.9,
          "en": "And I'll add a CategoriesScreen.js file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 30.9,
          "end": 32.08,
          "en": "The file name is up to you",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 32.08,
          "end": 35.47,
          "en": "but of course you wanna describe what's in that file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 35.47,
          "end": 37.96,
          "en": "And in that CategoriesScreen file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 37.96,
          "end": 41.653,
          "en": "I wanna create a function, CategoriesScreen,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 42.95,
          "end": 44.35,
          "en": "and of course export that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 44.35,
          "end": 46.54,
          "en": "because this is a component function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 46.54,
          "end": 48.03,
          "en": "a react component function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 48.03,
          "end": 51.073,
          "en": "as we created it many times before in this course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 52.03,
          "end": 55.51,
          "en": "And then, in there we wanna return some JSX code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 55.51,
          "end": 57.383,
          "en": "that outputs our categories.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 58.49,
          "end": 62.77,
          "en": "Now, to output the categories, we should import them.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 62.77,
          "end": 66.93299999999999,
          "en": "So I'm going to import them from this data folder,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 69.53,
          "end": 72.71000000000001,
          "en": "and they're from the dummy-data JS file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 72.71000000000001,
          "end": 75.78,
          "en": "And from there I'll import the categories",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 75.78,
          "end": 80.17,
          "en": "the constant that holds the categories has an all caps name.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 80.17,
          "end": 82.28999999999999,
          "en": "It's this constant.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 82.28999999999999,
          "end": 86.37,
          "en": "So, I'm importing this into my CategoriesScreen.js file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 86.37,
          "end": 89.95,
          "en": "and now we wanna output all those categories.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 89.95,
          "end": 92.86,
          "en": "Now, there will be different ways",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 92.86,
          "end": 95.86,
          "en": "of outputting the categories here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 95.86,
          "end": 97.1,
          "en": "We could, for example",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 97.1,
          "end": 100.72999999999999,
          "en": "use a FlatList to output all the categories.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 100.72999999999999,
          "end": 101.84,
          "en": "And you could do that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 101.84,
          "end": 105.88,
          "en": "if categories would be a list with a lot of items,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 105.88,
          "end": 108.49000000000001,
          "en": "or a dynamic list where you don't know",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 108.49000000000001,
          "end": 111.4,
          "en": "in advance how many items will be in there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 111.4,
          "end": 113.31,
          "en": "And then, for performance benefits,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 113.31,
          "end": 114.97999999999999,
          "en": "you wanna use a FlatList,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 114.97999999999999,
          "end": 117.88300000000001,
          "en": "which renders elements lazily as you learned.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 118.83,
          "end": 122.16,
          "en": "But here, actually, we wouldn't have to use a FlatList",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 122.16,
          "end": 124.72,
          "en": "because it's a limited amount of categories.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 124.72,
          "end": 125.76,
          "en": "And in this case,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 125.76,
          "end": 129.56,
          "en": "it's also some static data which is not going to change.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 129.56,
          "end": 131.58,
          "en": "Nonetheless, I'm going to use a FlatList",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 131.58,
          "end": 134.48,
          "en": "so that we get more practice with that component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 134.48,
          "end": 138.14,
          "en": "But I wanna emphasize that here, for this limited list",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 138.14,
          "end": 139.8,
          "en": "it would not be required.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 139.8,
          "end": 141.45,
          "en": "And using a scroll view,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 141.45,
          "end": 144.52,
          "en": "wrapped around the category items being mapped",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 144.52,
          "end": 148.253,
          "en": "into JSX elements manually, would be fine as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 149.13,
          "end": 151.05,
          "en": "Nonetheless, for the reasons mentioned,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 151.05,
          "end": 155.51,
          "en": "we can import FlatList here from React-Native",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 155.51,
          "end": 158.03300000000002,
          "en": "not react-native-Web, but react-native.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 159.15,
          "end": 162.73,
          "en": "And then, we can return our FlatList here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 162.73,
          "end": 163.963,
          "en": "in the CategoriesScreen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 165.597,
          "end": 168.27,
          "en": "And of course, now we need to set the data,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 168.27,
          "end": 171.63,
          "en": "and the data, that's our categories list",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 171.63,
          "end": 175.78,
          "en": "because categories asked to find in dummy data is an array.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 175.78,
          "end": 179.28300000000002,
          "en": "So that is, what we want to expose as data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 180.64,
          "end": 183.24,
          "en": "Now, if you take a look at these category items,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 183.24,
          "end": 184.9,
          "en": "you see that I'm creating them",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 184.9,
          "end": 188.96,
          "en": "with help of one of my models, the category model.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 188.96,
          "end": 190.45,
          "en": "And if you take a look at that you see",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 190.45,
          "end": 193.88,
          "en": "that the first parameter received in the constructor",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 193.88,
          "end": 196.69,
          "en": "is stored in an ID property.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 196.69,
          "end": 197.67000000000002,
          "en": "And besides that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 197.67000000000002,
          "end": 201.31,
          "en": "the categories have a title and a color property.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 201.31,
          "end": 203.29,
          "en": "So therefore, we have an ID property",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 203.29,
          "end": 205.73,
          "en": "for every category object,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 205.73,
          "end": 210.089,
          "en": "and no key property as FlatList would expect it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 210.089,
          "end": 212,
          "en": "Therefore, since we need a key,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 212,
          "end": 214.91,
          "en": "we should again set up the keyExtractor function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 214.91,
          "end": 217.85,
          "en": "as we did it many times before in this course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 217.85,
          "end": 219.73,
          "en": "And you learned that this is a function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 219.73,
          "end": 224.37,
          "en": "that receives the item as a parameter automatically.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 224.37,
          "end": 227.81,
          "en": "And it should then return a value that can be used as a key",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 227.81,
          "end": 232.1,
          "en": "for the individual items that are rendered by FlatList.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 232.1,
          "end": 234.44,
          "en": "So in this case, we can access item.id,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 234.44,
          "end": 238.4,
          "en": "since we know that the ID will be unique for every item.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 238.4,
          "end": 241.26,
          "en": "Now, of course we also should add a renderItem prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 241.26,
          "end": 243.47,
          "en": "to define a function that is executed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 243.47,
          "end": 246.16,
          "en": "for every item that then determines",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 246.16,
          "end": 248.78,
          "en": "how this item should be rendered.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 248.78,
          "end": 250.98,
          "en": "And for this, I'll add a little helper function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 250.98,
          "end": 254.11,
          "en": "which is totally optional, not something you have to do,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 254.11,
          "end": 254.98,
          "en": "but here I'll add",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 254.98,
          "end": 257.733,
          "en": "a helper function called rendeCategoryItem.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 260.1,
          "end": 263.26,
          "en": "And I get my item here, and then here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 263.26,
          "end": 267,
          "en": "I wanna return the JSX code for a single item.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 267,
          "end": 267.98,
          "en": "And I'm just doing this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 267.98,
          "end": 270.72,
          "en": "to keep the JSX code down there a bit leaner.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 270.72,
          "end": 273.24,
          "en": "That's the only reason you would not have",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 273.24,
          "end": 275.343,
          "en": "to define a separate function like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 276.26,
          "end": 277.093,
          "en": "Please note though,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 277.093,
          "end": 279.93,
          "en": "that it is defined outside of the component function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 279.93,
          "end": 282.55,
          "en": "Since it doesn't have to be recreated",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 282.55,
          "end": 284.85,
          "en": "when the component re-renders.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 284.85,
          "end": 287.38,
          "en": "At the moment the component should never re-render,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 287.38,
          "end": 288.53,
          "en": "but even if it would,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 288.53,
          "end": 291.37,
          "en": "this function doesn't have to be recreated, and therefore,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 291.37,
          "end": 294.453,
          "en": "it can be defined outside of the component function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 295.33,
          "end": 298.90999999999997,
          "en": "So now we can point at render category item here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 298.90999999999997,
          "end": 301.23,
          "en": "but of course, in render category item,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 301.23,
          "end": 303.58,
          "en": "we now have to set up the JSX code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 303.58,
          "end": 306.51,
          "en": "that should be output for a category.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 306.51,
          "end": 309.16,
          "en": "And for this I'll add a brand new component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 309.16,
          "end": 311.61,
          "en": "in a components' folder.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 311.61,
          "end": 313.18,
          "en": "This is also not required",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 313.18,
          "end": 317.11,
          "en": "but I wanna keep my individual files lean.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 317.11,
          "end": 319.1,
          "en": "And then, in that components folder",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 319.1,
          "end": 323.883,
          "en": "I'll add a CategoryGridTile JS file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 325.311,
          "end": 327.11,
          "en": "and it I'm naming it grid tile",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 327.11,
          "end": 329.38,
          "en": "because the categories will actually be rendered",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 329.38,
          "end": 331.98,
          "en": "as a grid of categories.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 331.98,
          "end": 333.54,
          "en": "And therefore, here I'll then create",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 333.54,
          "end": 337.4,
          "en": "my CategoryGridTile component function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 337.4,
          "end": 339,
          "en": "and of course export",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 339,
          "end": 342.61,
          "en": "that CategoryGridTile component function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 342.61,
          "end": 347.32,
          "en": "And then, in that component simply return some JSX code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 347.32,
          "end": 348.64,
          "en": "And now it's totally up to you",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 348.64,
          "end": 351.75,
          "en": "how such a grid tile should be styled.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 351.75,
          "end": 354.5,
          "en": "I will use a view here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 354.5,
          "end": 358.193,
          "en": "And for that, I'll import View from react-native.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 359.5,
          "end": 363.6,
          "en": "And in that View, I wanna have a Pressable component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 363.6,
          "end": 365.72,
          "en": "also imported from react-native,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 365.72,
          "end": 369.48,
          "en": "because those grid tiles later should be Pressable,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 369.48,
          "end": 374.05,
          "en": "so that they lead us to a new page, a new screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 374.05,
          "end": 377.69,
          "en": "We don't have that screen yet, but we want it for later.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 377.69,
          "end": 380.51,
          "en": "So, here I'll use Pressable inside View",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 380.51,
          "end": 383.44,
          "en": "and I'm structuring it like this because of the styling,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 383.44,
          "end": 385.69,
          "en": "which I'll apply which then should lead",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 385.69,
          "end": 387.203,
          "en": "to a good looking result.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 388.58,
          "end": 390.97,
          "en": "So then in there I'll have a never view,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
